Open questions and risks found while writing this
[ ] Section 12 insurer element name. The 7 Nov 2025 XSD names the Section 12 insurer rows Insurers, while Section 4, the CSV XSD and the answer JSON use Insurer. An XML download of Section 12 insurers may fail schema validation. Confirm which is correct.
[ ] Element order differs between XSDs. The full XSD orders MaxCoverPolicyUnlimited before MaxAmountCoverPolicy (and GuaranteeUnlimited before AmountCoverGuarantee); the CSV XSD has the reverse. xs:sequence enforces order, so the JSON-to-XML converter must follow the full XSD.
[ ] CSV XSD enum drift. The CSV XSD allows "Asset is not of a type referred to in CASS 15.4.2G" inside Article114ParagraphComplied; the full XSD keeps it in the separate AssetNotOfType element.
[ ] "Not Started" casing. REPConstants.NOT_STARTED is Not Started, but SQL writes 'NOT STARTED'. Check every comparison is case-insensitive.
[ ] Async pool sizing. AsyncConfig is sized for about 500 users with CallerRunsPolicy; under saturation, audit logging runs on request threads. Re-check against the 300-user NFR.
[ ] Rule logging. Rules print to stdout; consider a logger global before the KIE 10 move.
[ ] Snapshot age. The main service snapshot is from 1 July 2026; TaskJsonBuffer and previousQId are described from notes only. Upload a current snapshot to confirm sections 8 and 9.
[ ] Module count. Notes say 108 modules; the plan's register has 116 rows (some services listed twice) and its summary counts 72 microservices, 31 Lambdas, 10 libraries and 8 EMR jobs. Reconcile before wave sign-off.
